e934ef4660a4b62ead5bf1f91dfb438725115d7289eb41fe950d2ed803d" :answer-field/choices ["q-340677/field-2/45748e934ef4660a4b62ead5bf1f91dfb438725115d7289eb41fe950d2ed803d" "q-340677/field-2/61bbf40bf0728127bc167767b5af83361c3acbddac67f4a51d278c010c10af58"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-340677" :question/id #uuid "e05d9234-b5df-5b04-8082-fca6a02fdae1" :question/math-academy-id "q-340677" :question/problem "$$\n⟨f(x),g(x)⟩={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }f(x)g(x)\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\nGiven the inner product on the set of continuous functions over $x\\in [0,2\\pi )$ defined above, select the correct options below.$\\,$\n$⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x),\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)⟩=$\n{{field-1}}\n\n$\\,$\nThe functions $f(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)$ and $g(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)$ \n{{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "We begin by using the product-to-sum identity\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)=\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(8x)).\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into the integral gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x),\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)⟩ & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(8x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)-\\frac{1}{16}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(8x)]}_{0}^{2\\pi } \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4\\pi )-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(0))-\\frac{1}{16}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(16\\pi )-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(0)) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}(0-0)-\\frac{1}{16}(0-0) \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)$ and $g(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)$ $\\text{are orthogonal}$ with respect to the inner product." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-340677/field-1" "q-340677/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "fadf4f64-3569-56b2-98e1-f6681892054a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-340677"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-340638/field-1/5318a3aca702b19af2e8f3f6aaa62ceddfc358ccdcc4c44e2e1c6a5ae7495deb" :answer/id #uuid "991b13f2-9e76-526f-aa2b-e3606426ecaf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{⟨f(x),\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x)⟩}{⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x),\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x)⟩}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340638/field-1/1cb705c578c18d548f24a06e672d5ecf63522727b8aa3fbd7bf08d8a5d9e79e2" :answer/id #uuid "3fca65ab-d4f8-506c-8244-1454fdbec701" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{⟨f(x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)⟩}{⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x),\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x)⟩}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340638/field-1/bc752a1e12a0f5b97333fedd6867fa12839ca1039ec4919f451f86f5363c162e" :answer/id #uuid "51bac3f6-5d9f-5330-be87-38794b1793f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x),\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x)⟩}{⟨f(x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)⟩}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340638/field-1/88495b37fd40b97208105b443db68c41f90a179f8d88bbe2da56b16059fcc3a5" :answer/id #uuid "856435ed-a9a9-51e7-8f31-5fd2501a0185" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)⟩}{⟨f(x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)⟩}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340638/field-1/bd187683f018878cd5f96e362b562c9007466f0bc0a77fdb0133d33dcd14d89b" :answer/id #uuid "4ac667d6-105f-5847-8bf8-a9d7de392b7b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{⟨f(x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)⟩}{⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)⟩}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340638/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "3cfad3e7-2cc7-5452-81ab-5b0a32a1663c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-340638/field-1/bd187683f018878cd5f96e362b562c9007466f0bc0a77fdb0133d33dcd14d89b" :answer-field/choices ["q-340638/field-1/5318a3ac